      "writtenOn": "2016-08-11T09:10:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With PS5 and another benchmarking run, I\u0027m actually seeing better results with higher -j values. Though some of that may be because -j48 on a 48 (logical) core machine is using 3x the maximum memory usage of -j40 / -j56 or higher for some reason.",
      "parentUuid": "f927ab96_49d78515",
